    "body": "### Go version\n\ngo version go1.28-devel_8190b02cec linux/amd64\n\n### Output of `go env` in your module/workspace:\n\n```shell\nAR='ar'\nCC='gcc'\nCGO_CFLAGS='-O2 -g'\nCGO_CPPFLAGS=''\nCGO_CXXFLAGS='-O2 -g'\nCGO_ENABLED='1'\nCGO_FFLAGS='-O2 -g'\nCGO_LDFLAGS='-O2 -g'\nCXX='g++'\nGCCGO='gccgo'\nGO111MODULE=''\nGOAMD64='v1'\nGOARCH='amd64'\nGOAUTH='netrc'\nGOBIN='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/go/bin'\nGOCACHE='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/.cache/go-build'\nGOCACHEPROG=''\nGODEBUG=''\nGOENV='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/.config/go/env'\nGOEXE=''\nGOEXPERIMENT='simd'\nGOFIPS140='off'\nGOFLAGS=''\nGOGCCFLAGS='-fPIC -m64 -pthread -Wl,--no-gc-sections -fmessage-length=0 -ffile-prefix-map=/tmp/go-build2210645409=/tmp/go-build -gno-record-gcc-switches'\nGOHOSTARCH='amd64'\nGOHOSTOS='linux'\nGOINSECURE=''\nGOMOD='/dev/null'\nGOMODCACHE='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/go/pkg/mod'\nGONOPROXY=''\nGONOSUMDB=''\nGOOS='linux'\nGOPACKAGESDRIVER=''\nGOPATH='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/go'\nGOPRIVATE=''\nGOPROXY='https://proxy.golang.org,direct'\nGOROOT='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/go/git/go-tip'\nGOSUMDB='sum.golang.org'\nGOTELEMETRY='local'\nGOTELEMETRYDIR='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/.config/go/telemetry'\nGOTMPDIR=''\nGOTOOLCHAIN='auto'\nGOTOOLDIR='/usr/local/google/home/sjmuir/go/git/go-tip/pkg/tool/linux_amd64'\nGOVCS=''\nGOVERSION='go1.28-devel_8190b02cec Thu Sep 24 15:49:11 2026 -0700'\nGOWORK=''\nPKG_CONFIG='pkg-config'\n```\n\n### What did you do?\n\nAttempting to generate a version of `bytes.IndexByte` by using the SIMD API, got very ambitious with loop unrolling and decided that 8-way unrolling would be desirable. This worked great in earlier versions of Go, but when rebasing the change onto tip we found out that 8-way unrolling causes a compiler panic.\n\n### What did you see happen?\n\nCompiler panic due to spilling >7 K mask registers on AMD64.\n\nProgram that reproduces the bug: [https://go.dev/play/p/kLfBd5L1DAS](https://go.dev/play/p/kLfBd5L1DAS)\n\n### What did you expect to see?\n\nCompiler not panicking.\n\n[potential fix CL](https://go-review.googlesource.com/c/go/+/838845)\n",
