    "type": null,
    "active_lock_reason": null,
    "draft": false,
    "pull_request": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/golang/go/pulls/81766",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/golang/go/pull/81766",
      "diff_url": "https://github.com/golang/go/pull/81766.diff",
      "patch_url": "https://github.com/golang/go/pull/81766.patch",
      "merged_at": null
    },
    "body": "The SIMD rewriter generates a dispatcher body that calls each `@simdN`\r\nvariant. For methods, the call was generated as a bare function\r\nexpression (Foo@simd0) rather than a selector on the receiver, leaving\r\nthe type entry unset after re-typechecking and crashing the noder.\r\n    \r\nFixes golang/go#80657",
